OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump lands at Dublin
OL,4,AAirport for two-day visit to Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has just
OL,7,Ftouched down at Dublin Airport for the
OL,8,Fstart of his two-day visit to the
OL,9,FRepublic of Ireland
OL,11,FHe is due to hold a courtesy call with
OL,12,FIrish President Catherine Connolly, and
OL,13,Fa bilateral meeting with Taoiseach
OL,14,F(Irish Prime Minister) Micheal Martin
OL,16,FTrump will then travel to his golf
OL,17,Fresort in Doonbeg, County Clare, where
OL,18,Fthe Irish Open golf tournament is being
OL,19,Fheld
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
