OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump lands at Dublin
OL,4,AAirport for two-day visit to Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FIrish authorities have been planning
OL,7,Ffor Trump's visit for months in what
OL,8,Fwill be one of the biggest security
OL,9,Foperations in the history of the state
OL,11,FProtests against the president's visit
OL,12,Fare expected to be held in Dublin and
OL,13,FDoonbeg
